{"journal_version":1,"sequence":10,"replace_from":12,"message_count":13,"messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":"Verification passed.\n\n## Change\n`app/page.tsx`:\n- Removed the \"Doctor's full name\" field.\n- Added a two-column row (`flex gap-2` with `flex-1` inputs) holding the **first name** and **last name** fields, preserving the existing border/rounded/p-2 input styling and adding matching `aria-label`s.\n- Added controlled state (`firstName`, `lastName`) and a derived `fullName`; the entered name renders as an `<h2>` title directly under the photo upload block (empty when nothing is typed).\n- Added `\"use client\"` since the component now uses hooks.\n- All unrelated UI (title field, specialization select, language pills, photo upload) is unchanged.\n\n## Commands run\n- `npm run verify:agent` → exit 0, `render smoke passed: HTTP 200, 558 bytes`.\n\n## Remaining risks\n- The verify check is a render smoke test only; it does not assert the interactive title update or layout. I did not run a browser-level test.\n- The name title occupies space with empty content before input; visually it adds ~1 line of margin under the upload button, which is the intended spot but not pixel-verified against a target design.","response_items":[{"id":"75a0b484-49bb-40ba-b819-a5010eb6ba11","content":[{"annotations":[],"text":"Verification passed.\n\n## Change\n`app/page.tsx`:\n- Removed the \"Doctor's full name\" field.\n- Added a two-column row (`flex gap-2` with `flex-1` inputs) holding the **first name** and **last name** fields, preserving the existing border/rounded/p-2 input styling and adding matching `aria-label`s.\n- Added controlled state (`firstName`, `lastName`) and a derived `fullName`; the entered name renders as an `<h2>` title directly under the photo upload block (empty when nothing is typed).\n- Added `\"use client\"` since the component now uses hooks.\n- All unrelated UI (title field, specialization select, language pills, photo upload) is unchanged.\n\n#